@Nhom3ConCa_HostAddress = http://localhost:5188
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token

### Register a student
POST {{Nhom3ConCa_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Student@12345"
}

### Login (returns accessToken and refreshToken)
POST {{Nhom3ConCa_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUsername": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Student@12345"
}

### Current user
GET {{Nhom3ConCa_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Browse courses
GET {{Nhom3ConCa_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Browse class schedule
GET {{Nhom3ConCa_HostAddress}}/api/class-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
